flowchart TD
    A([Attendant opens receive-stock screen]) --> B[Select medicine and branch]
    B --> C[Enter receipt quantity]
    C --> D[GUI converts basic input values]
    D --> E[StockService validates positive integer quantity]
    E --> F{Medicine and branch exist?}
    F -- No --> G[Return meaningful error]
    F -- Yes --> H[StockRepository persists branch-specific receipt]
    H --> I[GUI displays success and refreshes branch stock]
    G --> J([Correct input / try again])
    I --> K([Complete])
